{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"平\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、core：X 的高亮短语即使脱离周围小字，也能串出靠近、害怕给对方压力、被看见后的不安、重新坦然喜欢以及接受幸福未必长久的过程；Y 的大块多次停留在「满足」「安宁」「不安」等概括，具体的关系变化和核心矛盾不够突出。small：平，X 的感受细节更丰富，Y 的感受与旁注层次更清楚，但两边都有有效补充，也都有与大字近义重复的地方；concise：X 略胜，Y 多次反复表达满足、不安、想留住亲近和舍不得，部分小字又重复大块。human、fine：X 胜，Y 的「更深地交给这份亲近」「不再把这个可能当成眼前幸福的否定」等表达偏书面、抽象；X 的「怕自己太黏」「白天相处得很好，独处时心头泛酸」「欢喜压得心口发疼」更接近日常表达，也保留了具体、有辨识度的体验。load：X 胜，高亮短语短而且大多落在自然的意群边界，虽然一屏有时出现多个，但相对于停留时间容易扫完；Y 的大块往往较长，部分屏幕需要连续读完多块才能抓住重点。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3b5c019a-4b56-4eaa-889c-92f07541990b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T062722164338Z", "elapsed_seconds": 168.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T06:30:10.973678+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "acee9a9ac99fd5a025a54f9d757509a3ad58fc40c15073132c32ba9109ed6b8d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3